	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Starting at 18th level, your command of your allies’ movement intensifies. All allies within the range of your Commanding Presence may benefit from your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.G8IYDrkBrOQSFKay]{Come By} ability.</p><p>Additionally, allies who move as a result of this ability may either cast one cantrip or make a single weapon attack against the enemy creature. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
